quality_filter: PAINS catalog loaded; synthesizability metric = SA_Score (reject SA > 6.0) [SA_Score (MorganGenerator shim)].
usage: validate_docking.py [-h] [--library-dir LIBRARY_DIR]
                           [--n-sample N_SAMPLE] [--top-k TOP_K] [--seed SEED]
                           [--output OUTPUT]

Diagnose whether the PfDHFR docking objective tracks real binding or a
molecular-size / lipophilicity artifact.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --library-dir LIBRARY_DIR
                        Cached library directory (default data/library).
  --n-sample N_SAMPLE   Target docking-score sample size (default 150).
                        Existing outputs + cache are reused first; only the
                        shortfall is docked fresh.
  --top-k TOP_K         Top-K set size for the LE re-ranking comparison.
  --seed SEED           RNG seed for the random fresh-dock top-up sample.
  --output OUTPUT       Path for the saved scatter figure.
